# 🤖 2. AI in IT Support

AI tools can significantly improve troubleshooting speed, accuracy, and documentation quality — when used responsibly.

---

# 2.1 How AI Helps IT Support

### ✔ Faster troubleshooting  
AI can interpret logs, error messages, and symptoms.

### ✔ Better documentation  
AI can rewrite, summarise, or structure notes.

### ✔ Improved communication  
AI can draft clear user-facing messages.

### ✔ Learning & upskilling  
AI explains concepts in simple terms.

### ✔ PowerShell assistance  
AI helps generate, debug, and optimise scripts.

