# 2.3 AI-Assisted Troubleshooting Workflow

1. Gather symptoms  
2. Collect logs  
3. Redact sensitive data  
4. Ask AI for interpretation  
5. Validate suggestions  
6. Apply fix  
7. Document resolution  
8. Use AI to polish documentation  

AI supports the process — it does not replace your judgement.

